/T (In this project, different business-related questions were solved using SQL queries on the pizza sales dataset. Each query was written to analyze specific aspects of the data, such as total sales, popular pizza types, order patterns, and revenue generation. By solving these questions, I was able to gain a better understanding of the dataset and identify useful insights related to pizza sales performance. This process also helped strengthen my SQL skills in data analysis and query writing.)
/E (In this project, different business-related questions were solved using SQL queries on the pizza sales dataset. Each query was written to analyze specific aspects of the data, such as total sales, popular pizza types, order patterns, and revenue generation. By solving these questions, I was able to gain a better understanding of the dataset and identify useful insights related to pizza sales performance. This process also helped strengthen my SQL skills in data analysis and query writing.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
